Z||000009||Joe Torma||12-30-2001||06:11 PM||||Setting the pintle at that length or more inbound is important to not risk damaging it when installing it.<P>WCF...I've posted the not so well known "setting base idle" procedure here a few times, you may want to include it.  Its especially important with 3.1/3.4 conversions.<P>------------------<BR>Its never going to be finished...<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/sig2_2.gif"> ||||reg||1
